OL,3,AMore Mandelson papers set to be
OL,4,Apublished before Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is preparing to publish
OL,7,Fmore documents about the appointment of
OL,8,FLord Mandelson as US ambassador.
OL,10,FBatches of papers were published in
OL,11,FMarch and June - but others were
OL,12,Fwithheld because they were part of a
OL,13,FMetropolitan Police investigation.
OL,15,FThe Cabinet Office has now said a
OL,16,Fnumber of extra documents will be
OL,17,Fpublished, likely before Christmas.
OL,18,FSome will still be withheld at the
OL,19,Frequest of the Met.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
