OL,3,AMore Mandelson papers set to be
OL,4,Apublished before Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FCat Little, permanent secretary at the
OL,7,FCabinet Office, said that some of the
OL,8,Fdocuments could "now be published
OL,9,Fwithout prejudicing their
OL,10,Finvestigation".
